        "collapsible_tab_UWQ8gk": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Overview",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Overview",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>The LEGEE-688 is HOBOT Technology's 4-in-1 floor cleaning robot. Where most robots vacuum or mop, the LEGEE-688 does both in a single pass, vacuum, dry mop, AI smart spray, and wet mop, in that order. The patented FastBrush system vibrates the mopping cloth 600 to 800 times per minute.</p><p><strong>Real Coverage, Real Modes</strong><br/>7 Talent Clean modes cover everything from ECO to Kitchen to Pet mode, each independently controlling spray, vacuum, mopping, and speed. LEGEE Smart Navigation, a five-sensor fusion system, gives it a real-time floor map instead of a random bounce pattern.</p><p><strong>Our Take</strong><br/>Our recommendation for homes with hard floors, pets, or kitchen grease, Kitchen Mode's two-pass stain system alone makes it a more capable daily driver than a basic sweep-and-mop robot.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_Uf69Wz": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Product Information",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Product Information",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p><strong>Curated by Yard Automation Pros.</strong></p><h3>FastBrush 4-in-1</h3><p>An exclusive HOBOT patent. One pass handles vacuum, dry mop, AI smart spray, and wet mop simultaneously, with the mopping cloth running at 600–800 vibrations per minute for active scrubbing.</p><h3>LEGEE Smart Navigation</h3><p>Five-sensor fusion, laser, encoder, gyro, e-compass, and position estimation, delivers systematic, map-based coverage with three front lasers.</p><h3>7 Talent Clean Modes</h3><p>Standard, Strong, ECO, Kitchen, Polish, Dry, Pet, and one fully user-configurable mode. Kitchen Mode divides the floor into 1.5 × 1.5m sections and makes two passes, first dissolving stubborn stains, then absorbing them.</p><h3>Built for Real Households</h3><p>A D-shaped design with a 4cm side brush reaches corners and under cabinets round robots miss. Two-layer filtration (washable screen plus HEPA) and a tangle-free microfiber cloth system mean no roller brush, no hair tangles.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_X7L37G": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Warranty & Support",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Warranty & Support",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>Covered by HOBOT's manufacturer warranty against defects in materials and workmanship. We reply to emails within 1 business day at support@yardautomationpros.com.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_HjeTwa": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Setup & Installation",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Setup & Installation",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>Place the charging station against a wall with clear space on either side, and let the robot fully charge before first use. Fill the water tank using the included graduated container, and install a mopping cloth and filter (both come pre-installed, with spares in the box). Control cleaning modes, view the real-time map, and set a schedule through the HOBOT LEGEE app (iOS/Android, Wi-Fi). The robot returns to its charging station automatically using 4-meter IR detection.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_czbJiW": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Specifications",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Specifications",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<h3>Navigation &amp; Cleaning</h3><ul><li><strong>Navigation:</strong> LEGEE Smart Navigation (laser + encoder + gyro + e-compass + position estimation)</li><li><strong>Cleaning system:</strong> FastBrush 4-in-1, mopping speed 600–800 times/min</li><li><strong>Cleaning routes:</strong> Zigzag, wall-follow, auto (4.4 × 4.4m² sections)</li><li><strong>Drive:</strong> Non-slipping caterpillar belts</li><li><strong>Side brush:</strong> 4cm extension, one-hand detachable</li></ul><h3>Capacity &amp; Filtration</h3><ul><li><strong>Water tank:</strong> 320 ml, covers approximately 150 m² per fill</li><li><strong>Trash bin:</strong> 500 ml</li><li><strong>Filter:</strong> Two-layer (washable screen 600# + HEPA)</li></ul><h3>Battery &amp; Connectivity</h3><ul><li><strong>Battery:</strong> Li-Ion 2750 mAh</li><li><strong>Runtime:</strong> Approximately 90 minutes</li><li><strong>Charge time:</strong> Approximately 150 minutes</li><li><strong>Wi-Fi:</strong> 802.11 b/g/n</li><li><strong>App:</strong> HOBOT LEGEE (iOS/Android)</li></ul><h3>Physical</h3><ul><li><strong>Dimensions:</strong> 340 × 330 × 95mm</li><li><strong>Weight:</strong> Approximately 3.2 kg</li><li><strong>Suitable floors:</strong> Tile, wood, laminate, marble, glass, epoxy (hard floors only, not for carpets)</li></ul><h3>What's in the Box</h3><ul><li>LEGEE-688 Robot</li><li>Charging station</li><li>Microfiber mopping cloths (1 installed + 1 spare)</li><li>Spray nozzles (2 installed + 4 spare)</li><li>Filters (1 installed + 2 spare HEPA)</li><li>Side brushes (3 spare)</li><li>Graduated water container</li><li>Remote control + 2 AAA batteries</li><li>User manual</li></ul>"
          }
        },
